From 3aa8e1232d04cb876180a0cdcc471014fdcb9192 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: noname713705 <noname713705@gmail.com>
Date: Tue, 13 Oct 2026 00:18:39 +0200
Subject: [PATCH] Build REL-0.5 with gradle-0.4

- deps from Maven Central (groups, addMavenRepo, svnkit 1.3.5), ivy 2.0.0-rc2 kept
- Maven URL https without trailing slash (DependencyManager.java)
- build scripts adapted to the 0.4 builder: BootstrapUtil -> GradleUtil, addConfiguration with
  an ivy Configuration, dependency(['runtime'], ...) {}, init.doFirst {task, graph} instead of
  build.taskGraph.whenReady, no groovyOptions
- maven-ant-tasks: exclude ant (ant:ant:1.6.2 breaks Ant 1.7.0)
- tests disabled, buildSrc VersionTest removed
- builder started with only BootstrapMain on java.class.path (see TODO.adoc)

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
---
 build.gradle                                  |  94 ++++++------
 buildSrc/build.gradle                         |  10 +-
 .../gradle/build/release/VersionTest.groovy   | 134 ------------------
 .../org/gradle/api/DependencyManager.java     |   2 +-
 4 files changed, 58 insertions(+), 182 deletions(-)
 delete mode 100644 buildSrc/src/test/groovy/org/gradle/build/release/VersionTest.groovy

